check_box.tool_tip:
Profile RLVa commands, from the i-doll fork by Amalthea Skydancer. While this is off they are refused as disabled; restrictions already set can still be lifted.

@editprofile=n : can't edit your profile text and images
@editpicks=n : can't create, edit or delete picks
@editdisplayname=n : can't change your display name
@editpfp=n : can't change your profile picture
@setprofileimage:<texture UUID>=force : sets your profile picture
@blockedimmsg:<text>=force : sets the reply sent when RLV blocks you from answering an IM (@blockedimmsg=force clears it)

Other Firestorm-only RLVa commands in this viewer (always available):
@showareasearch=n : blocks Area Search
@showfavwear=n : blocks Wearable Favorites
@showlookat=n : hides LookAt crosshairs
@sendlookat=n : sends your real LookAt target even with private LookAt on
@showcontacts=n : hides the friends list and friends' online status
@showsearch=n : blocks Search and greys out its toolbar button
@worldsounds=n, @soundothers=n, @soundself=n : mute object sounds, other avatars' sounds, your own sounds. Add :<UUID>=add to keep one source audible; @worldsounds and @soundothers also take :<metres>=n to keep nearby sounds audible

